          "description": "The knee up is the first step where the jack and the legs have to agree. One knee lifts to around hip height on the beat while the standing leg keeps bouncing, then the feet change. It builds the balance of the one-leg bounce into something rhythmic, and it is the entry point for kicks, the farmer and many twist combinations.",
