          "description": "Loose legs is less a single step than a way of moving the legs that shows up across house. The free knee turns in towards the standing leg and then the lower leg flicks out to the side, loose from the knee down, before the weight changes and the other leg does the same. It only works when the legs stop bracing — which is why it is often taught early, as permission to relax the whole lower body.",
