          "danceSlug": "ball-change",
          "summary": "A quick step onto the ball of one foot and straight back onto the other.",
          "description": "The ball change is a fast weight change: step onto the ball of one foot on the \"and\", then change straight back onto the other foot on the beat. With a kick in front of it, it becomes the kick ball change, one of the most common connectors in house. It is how dancers switch lead foot or add a syncopated accent without stopping.",
